{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act13d5_level_act13d5_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act13d5",
  "stageId": "act13d5_07",
  "title": "梅什科集团",
  "storyCode": "MN-7",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13d5/level_act13d5_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d406dc4a0a1337c33a4a7fde49f3e29cf9d1cadb9519158ce1a518ad84343dba",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔 7上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_courtyard"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......比赛已经开始了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "必须......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，我的剑为什么会在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仆人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，是玛莉娅小姐之前送过来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仆人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玛莉娅小姐还说，已经帮您调整好了武器的状态，保证焕然一新。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仆人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呀——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔......这么轻盈，真怀念这个手感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仆人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请、请小心一点！哎呀，您又把栏杆弄坏了！去年才让石雕匠改建的维多利亚石柱风格......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就索性让人把宅子全部翻新一遍好了，你来负责吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仆人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸、又这么随意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能住人就行......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仆人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊，没事，我只是......突然感到有些怀念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这把剑......是玛莉娅的爷爷送给我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仆人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玛莉娅小姐喊您姑母呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真要论辈分的话可混乱了。我还记得玛嘉烈是怎么说的——“这是你的......你的......你就喊姑母吧。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明明和她们两差不多大吧？居然喊姑母？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仆人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您还很年轻，而且这么年轻就有这份家业，我们也为您自豪，佐菲娅小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一口气买下这么大的宅邸，那时候我是不是也想着证明自己，证明自己配得上那个“临光”的名号，配得上耀骑士呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......现在不是怀念过去的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仆人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "车已经为您备好了，还是说，您觉得自己跑过去更快？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那当然是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_sportsbar"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如同戏耍猎物的猎手，左手骑士一次次给予对手重整旗鼓的机会，再一次次击垮玛莉娅·临光！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "马丁！我们回来了，现在是什么情况！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么玛莉娅会和那种级别的对手交战啊？骑士协会都疯了吗！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这说来话长......那几个孩子安全了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暂时安全了，只能这么说，现在他们已经被剥夺合法骑士身份了，呸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我从来没想过事情会夸张成这样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "灰毫，焰尾，还有另外两个没有封号的感染者骑士，以及他们花所有资产从竞技场里买回来的感染者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些斗士，那些供人取乐的感染者都是些孩子！最大的不过二十来岁，最小的才——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算躲藏在那些管道之间，只要一天不离开这座城邦，就谈不上什么安全，而且人数很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的老朋友会照顾他们的，但他们毕竟是感染者，事情不会这么简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这下我们可不光在和企业叫板了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怕了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怕！？乌萨斯人把长枪塞我嘴里的时候我都没怕过！毕竟我也是乌萨斯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放屁，工匠团什么时候离开过城头？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊！？大铁匠铺被投石机炸烂的时候，我们不冲上去难道要在屋里等死吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......玛莉娅不能赢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，现在的玛莉娅遇到这样的对手，的确赢不了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不对，不是赢不了，是不能赢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "骑士协会太过大张旗鼓了，加上之前冒出来的那个恰尔内，事情不会那么简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_arena_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（胳、胳膊快要脱臼了......他的枪，完全没法近身——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（——不，就算近身了也赢不了......怎么办......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "继续。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（咬牙起身）唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就摇摇欲坠了吗？真是像极了你那苟延残喘的“骑士家族”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "起来，继续。消灭一个骑士最好的办法，就是消灭他们的尊严。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "挑衅！三番五次的挑衅！以胜利者的睥睨敌手！“左手”泰特斯，真是令人生畏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在奖池已经完全一边倒了，惊人的比例和数字！这个金额，恐怕相当于此时此刻全卡西米尔的竞技场金额之和！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！加把劲啊临光！万一你爆冷了，我赢的钱就够买下一座城堡了啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你疯了吧？你给她下了多少钱？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我投给左手的钱更多！不过这样完全赚不到啊，还是对冲投资了一点！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喝啊......哈......哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无谋的梦想家......也想成为骑士了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不会杀你，弃权吧，往昔不会因为你的弃权而消逝，你放弃的只有你自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在......同情我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——没错，因为你根本不值得被我作骑士看待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看过你的比赛录像，从瑟奇亚克开始，竞速，混战......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我费神费力关注着“临光家的新骑士”，而你每一次侥幸的获胜都是对我的侮辱——就凭你，也胆敢如此浪费我的时间？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "站稳了，玛莉娅·临光，我来告诉你，你和那个耀骑士有如天壤之别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她的光辉能淹没对手的意志，她的激昂令我颤抖，她的才华让人嫉恨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你——战胜你轻而易举，我要彻底把你的意志磨灭成灰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "击飞！！泰特斯再次打飞了玛莉娅的武器！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊，这样反复的蹂躏实在太过摧残身心，但是没关系！竞技场不光允许血肉横飞，更允许骑士以实力践踏一切！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "挑衅！试压！摧毁！这就是“左手”泰特斯，对弱者无情的倾轧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（好重......！而且盾竟然裂开了！？这可是姐姐留下的！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（锋刃上有能量法术的痕迹——他的法术——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "耀骑士不如黑骑士强大，不如血骑士恐怖，她只是正好在水准最低的一届特锦赛，侥幸赢得了冠军而已——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——即使如此安慰自己，我也深知差距所在，而与她相对比，你的软弱简直让我为你可悲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也许......的确不如姐姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我也是——临光家的骑士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......扎眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（随手一拨——！？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "够了！别再用你打发英格拉的法术来侮辱我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不该再站起来了，即使你的盔甲再坚固，你现在也应当痛苦不堪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无言的起剑，至少你的韧性值得嘉奖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思——让一下，让一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总算看得见了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......玛莉娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了，连说话的力气都没有了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "气息紊乱，脚步虚浮......你到底还有什么胜机可言？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左手骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_105",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "贵族骑士，高级商业骑士，特锦赛老牌骑士选手泰特斯·白杨再一次眯起了眼——\n——光芒刺眼。"
